{
  "slug": "cc-native",
  "name": "Cc Native",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "cc-native keeps your Claude Code configuration aware of weekly feature changes.\n\nBundles a Guide-and-Verify workflow: an always-current edit-time skill (feature-guide), lint hooks for .claude/ artifacts, and a read-only audit subagent (auditor) that  catches schema drift before edits ship.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `feature-guide` (TRIGGER when designing, editing, or generating any Claude Code config under .claude/ or .mcp.json (agents, skills, hooks, settings,…)\n- **Agents** (1): `auditor` (Reviews Claude Code config artifacts (.claude/ files, .mcp.json, plugin manifests) for semantic correctness against the cc-native:feature-guide skill references)\n- **Hooks** (4): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cc-native@claude-community` from `GarySonyak/cc-native`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 4
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Gary Sonyak"
  },
